        <ul class="list-none p-0 m-0 grid gap-2 text-ink-2">
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-tomato font-label">▶</span> <span>Writing a stage play, <a class="bio-link" href="/writing/if-theyll-never-hear-you">If They’ll Never Hear You</a>, opening April 2027</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-tomato font-label">▶</span> <span>Making cozy little desktop apps like <a class="bio-link" href="/projects/half-baked">Half-Baked</a> and <a class="bio-link" href="/projects/bubblist">Bubblist</a></span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-tomato font-label">▶</span> Researching how people learn with AI</li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-tomato font-label">▶</span> <span>Learning Russian with <a class="bio-link" href="/projects/tetrad">Тетрадь</a>, a flashcard app I built</span></li>
